{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_13111240","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13111240","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:6:1311124001:1":{"text":"お待ちください。リュボミル子爵の荘園へどのようなご用件でしょうか？ご主人様とのご予約はおありですか？","source_cn":"各位，请留步。请问你们是什么人？为何要前来柳博米尔子爵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD28E1ED2D83ED926","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311124002:1":{"text":"な、なな！？燭台が動いて、喋ったあっ！？","source_cn":"等等，你先等等！你是个会说话、会动的……烛台？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A7867C826232CD2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311124003:1":{"text":"私は、ご主人様より永寂の荘園の管理を任されている、執事のキャンデラと申します。","source_cn":"瓦茨拉夫，为您效劳。我是柳博米尔子爵的管家，负责永寂庄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F492A549D073EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311124004:1":{"text":"リュボミルさんは子爵様なんですね！","source_cn":"哇，柳博米尔还是一位子爵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C498E45FB42F889","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311124005:1":{"text":"さようでございます。ヴァレサ家に生まれたご主人様は、赤子の時に叔父である当時の大公様から子爵位を賜られたのですよ。","source_cn":"当然！柳博米尔先生与历任白山大公同属瓦勒沙家族，一出生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F3D2E2339D50823","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_tit